  "title": "ForestSignal California (1985\u20132025)",
  "description": "A 30-meter spatial resolution, 41-year Landsat-derived data cube covering California's forest, shrubland, and grassland properties from 1985 to 2025. Contains 19 thematic layers spanning vegetation, hydrology, fire hazard, carbon stocks, die-off risk, and disturbance severity. Built with a unified methodology emphasizing temporal and cross-property consistency to support change tracking and ecological decision-making.",
